                                "sense_id": "8a4f162b-f318-36a6-9b8d-a7b1701a81a5",
                                "text": "Miss D. had found that regular blinking, or a loud-ticking watch, or horizontal lines or marks on the ground, etc., similarly served to pace her, and to prevent the incontinent hastenings and retardations which otherwise marred her ambulation."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9b590b1b-cdde-4c26-8d59-9f83cf3037c4",
                                "sense_id": "8a4f162b-f318-36a6-9b8d-a7b1701a81a5",
                                "text": "The secret seems to be a very precise control of the subtle slackenings and hastenings of tempo that are essential to Scriabin's idiom[…]"
                            }
                        ]
